WEBVTT

00:01:59.422 --> 00:02:02.280
We jumped out of the house

00:02:02.304 --> 00:02:03.830
instead of the fire.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:09.910
North Korea is unimaginable.

00:02:10.998 --> 00:02:13.207
It's very hard for me

00:02:13.231 --> 00:02:17.331
when people ask me
what it feels like to live there.

00:02:18.579 --> 00:02:20.686
To be honest,

00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:21.947
I tell you:

00:02:21.971 --> 00:02:24.424
you can't even imagine it.

00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:31.608
The words in any language can't describe,